# While Rockford hatched, the slime let through what its C64 random numbers
# allowed: the emerald, the nut, the chasing boulder (which went after
# Rockford then) and the flying boulder; the boulder and the waiting boulder
# wait above it, the flying emerald below; the bladder did not get through at
# the first scan and stays below it for good
= @2,3=DIAMOND* @4,3=NUT* @3,3=CHASING_STONE @9,1=FLYING_STONE*
= @3,1=STONE @5,1=WAITING_STONE @10,3=FLYING_DIAMOND @8,3=BLADDER*
20.
= @8,3=BLADDER* @8,1=SPACE
